chest.alcove_f3.flavor = Inside the chest, a fresh urchin spike, still salt-bright.
chest.alcove_f4.flavor = Two perlemoen, packed in seaweed. The trader will pay for these.
chest.cache.flavor = Half-buried in the ruin's sand: a barnacled fishing hook, lost off some deck - its point still wicked-sharp.
chest.empty = The chest is empty - you took everything from it last time.
chest.got_weapon = Got the %s.
chest.left_weapon = Bag full - left the %s.
