lantern.already = The lantern is already burning. Its halo wobbles in the wind.
lantern.single = The lantern flickers and steadies. Warm light spills onto the planks.
lantern.final.1 = The third lantern catches and steadies. Three flames in a line, paint the dock.
lantern.final.2 = Down at the hull, ropes creak. The gangplank lowers itself into place.

